 "leakage_canary_note": "distance_to_truth and kernel_credit_of_truth use the FULL catalogue including the hidden segments and are the positive control that the canary fires on leaked features. The visible-only per-fold features and the masked candidate surfaces are the real canary; AUC > 0.90 there means leakage until proven otherwise.",
